752
00:45:20,820 --> 00:45:22,650
AS HIE MEE LESH SHILLEY URREE DY CHOOILLEY

753
00:45:22,650 --> 00:45:26,099
LAA DY YANNOO SHICKYR DY ROW EE DY

754
00:45:26,099 --> 00:45:26,460
MIE

755
00:45:33,030 --> 00:45:36,059
SKEEAL MYCHIONE BREE Y VOGHREY AS YN RAGHLID

756
00:45:36,059 --> 00:45:38,910
JEANJEE AS CREID CHEET STIAGH DY VE NY

757
00:45:38,909 --> 00:45:41,610
CHARREY JEES Y DOILLEEID ECK VA SHEN RY

758
00:45:41,610 --> 00:45:43,859
CHLASHTYN AYNS CLAARE NY GAEL FASTYR BEG YN

759
00:45:43,860 --> 00:45:44,280
DOONEE

760
00:45:45,599 --> 00:45:48,179
AYNS LESH SHEN TA SHIN CHEET GYS JERREY

761
